2T20:02:08Z","email":"jason@openc3.com","name":"Jason Thomas"},"message":"ci(trivy): scan the UBI images\n\nScan all 11 UBI images with Trivy. The PR scan lives in build_ubi.yml\nrather than trivy.yml because the UBI images are never published, so\nscanning them anywhere else would mean building all of them a second\ntime with no GHCR build cache to fall back on.\n\nThe post release scan reads the published docker.io/openc3inc/*-ubi\ntags and attaches its results as separate trivy_results_ubi and\nsbom_ubi release assets, keeping the two distributions'' reports apart.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e425c7a8b0360d7c01eeb658cd4b3f7e598851b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OpenC3/cosmos/git/trees/e425c7a8b0360d7c01eeb658cd4b3f7e598851b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OpenC3/cosmos/git/commits/7b5735efba2f8c1c4098c2d56c1adcb96210cf62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176403?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmthomas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmthomas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmthomas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmthomas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jmthomas","id":176403,"login":"jmthomas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NjQwMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmthomas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmthomas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmthomas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmthomas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmthomas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmthomas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/OpenC3/cosm