","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmthomas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmthomas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmthomas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmthomas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OpenC3/cosmos/commits/cb391613e0623182470d6692417fcff53c93e148/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T15:32:23Z","email":"jason@openc3.com","name":"Jason Thomas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T15:32:23Z","email":"jason@openc3.com","name":"Jason Thomas"},"message":"fix(tables): write table_create_report output to the target\n\ntable_create_report returned the report contents but never created a file,\nso scripts had no way to retrieve it with get_target_file. The write was\nremoved from Table.report in #2574 to stop the Table Manager GUI from\ncreating files in the bucket on download, which broke the script API that\nshared the endpoint. Saving is now opt-in: the script API requests it, the\nGUI does not.\n\nAlso replace whatever extension the binary has instead of only ''.bin''. A\nbinary named foo.tbl produced a report named foo.tbl, which overwrote the\nbinary once saving was restored.\n\nFixes #3725\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"864f57c0ef4a34a5e8abf467c1a5f048cb28a4b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OpenC3/cosmos/git/trees/864f57c0ef4a34a5e8abf467c1a5f048cb28a4b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OpenC3/cosmos/git/commits/cb391613e0623182470d6692417fcff53c93e148","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176403?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmthomas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmthomas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.